				"⣿⣿⠃⠀⠀",
				395,
				181
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Wind): Consolidate source structure and clean up build configuration\n\nThis commit completes the structural consolidation of the Wind project by removing the now-empty `Archive` directory and deleting outdated backup and test files.\n\nFollowing the previous migration of files from `Source/Archive/*` to the root `Archive/*`, the `Archive` directory at the root has been purged. This cleanup removes stale backup files (`.Backup.ts`), the old `Archive/tsconfig.json`, and a suite of integration and application tests that were likely obsoleted by the architectural shift to Effect-TS.\n\nAdditionally, the ESBuild configuration (`Target.ts`) has been updated to explicitly externalize Tauri API dependencies (`@tauri-apps/api`) and the `@codeeditorland/output` dependency. This ensures that these modules are resolved at runtime rather than bundled, aligning with the Tauri webview environment.\n\nThe root `tsconfig.json` has also been refined to remove the exclusion of `Source/Archive` (which no longer exists) and to strictly include only the `Source` directory, keeping the build scope clean and aligned with the new directory layout.",
			"SHA": "77de2330f18e982a4f762964a0df12428d9b1685"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-01-31T20:49:33Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⡏⠀⠀⠀",
				646,
				213
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Wind): Restructure project layout to flat 'Archive' directory\n\nThis commit flattens the Wind project's directory structure by relocating all source files from the nested `Source/Archive/*` path to the top-level `Archive/*` directory.\n\nThis architectural cleanup removes an unnecessary layer of nesting from the monorepo structure, simplifying the module resolution and import paths for the Wind service layer. The move encompasses the entire `Application` domain (including Define, Implement, Problem, and Convert files), as well as `Integration`, `Platform`, `TypeConverter`, `Bridge`, and `Effect` utilities.\n\nAdditionally, the TypeScript build output has been updated to reflect these changes, regenerating declaration files and source maps for the affected modules and the build cache (`tsconfig.tsbuildinfo`).",
			"SHA": "17c7dc37050b9e16cb566a10d5d8b90104a0b325"
		}
	],
